    <tags>openframe msp rmm it-management console notifications</tags>
    <summary>Desktop app of the OpenFrame platform: your OpenFrame workspace in its own window, with notifications that keep arriving from the tray</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[**OpenFrame Console** is the desktop app of the [OpenFrame](https://openframe.ai/) platform (remote monitoring and management for MSPs) by Flamingo AI, Inc. It requires an OpenFrame account: sign in with your email and the app finds your workspace.

What it adds over the browser tab: OS notifications that keep arriving while the app sits in the tray, a session that survives long idle, and Start at Login.

**Installs for the user who runs choco**, into `%LOCALAPPDATA%\OpenFrame Console`, with Start menu and desktop shortcuts. Run choco from that user's own elevated terminal: an install from another account (or SYSTEM) lands in that account's profile.

**Updates:** the app updates itself from your OpenFrame environment; `choco upgrade openframe-console` installs the newest package version over it.

**Uninstall** (`choco uninstall openframe-console`) removes the app silently. Settings and the session stay in `%APPDATA%\com.openframe.console`.

Documentation: https://github.com/flamingo-stack/openframe-oss-frontend/blob/main/apps/desktop/README.md#install
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/flamingo-stack/openframe-oss-frontend/releases/tag/$version$</releaseNotes>
